  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1412.01 Process for Modifications to the RTAP List",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1412.01 Process for Modifications to the RTAP List. As specified in RSA 125-I:4, V, all additions, deletions and modifications to any part of the RTAP list shall be made through the rulemaking process described in RSA 541-A.\n\nSource. #6468-B, eff 3-5-97; ss by #6739-B, eff 5-8-98; amd by #7859, eff 4-11-03; ss and moved by #8278, eff 2-4-05 (from Env-A 1413.01); ss by #9601, eff 11-25-09; ss by #12443, eff 1-5-18; ss by #13334, eff 2-3-22",
